<h3 class="muted">Rooms & Amenities</h3>
<div class="faq-block">
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>What amenities are included?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>
      Bathroom amenities including towels, shampoo, body wash, and more are provided.
      For details, feel free to check our <%= link_to "rooms", rooms_path %>.
    </h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>Is Wi-Fi available?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Yes, free high-speed Wi-Fi is available throughout the hotel.</h6>
  </div>
  <hr>
  <div class="faqquestion" data-action="click->faq#toggle">
    <h5>Are toiletries replenished daily?</h5>
    <h5 class="plus">+</h5>
  </div>
  <div class="faqanswer d-none" data-faq-target="answer">
    <h6>Yes, housekeeping will replenish them during your stay.</h6>
  </div>
</div>
